JSON-схема для CRM tool:
```json
{
  "name": "update_lead_status",
  "description": "Обновить status лида в Salesforce. Идемпотентна.",
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "lead_id": {"type": "string"},
      "new_status": {"type": "string", "enum": ["qualified", "contacted", "closed"]}
    },
    "required": ["lead_id", "new_status"]
  }
}
```

Затем prompt: «Лид #4521 ответил yes на demo. Обнови статус.» Claude вызовет `update_lead_status({lead_id:"4521", new_status:"qualified"})`.

Workflow:
1. Define tools с описанием **эффектов**, не только параметров
2. Pass tools в API call
3. Claude returns tool_use block
4. Your code executes function, returns result
5. Claude continues conversation с результатом

sys-rate-limiting.example:
B2B AI-platform, mixed traffic.

Stack: token-bucket rate limiter (Redis-backed) перед каждым Anthropic-вызовом + retry middleware с exponential backoff + circuit breaker (Resilience4j-style).

```python
@circuit_breaker(failure_threshold=5, timeout=30)
@retry(max_attempts=3, backoff=exponential_jitter(base=1.0, max=60))
@rate_limit(bucket="interactive", rate=400_rpm)  # 80% of Tier 3 limit
def call_claude(prompt, user_id):
    user_quota.consume(user_id, cost=1)  # per-user quota
    return anthropic.messages.create(...)
```

Dashboard ([[node:sys-monitoring|monitoring]]):
- 429 rate: norm < 0.5%, alert > 2%
- Backoff delay p95: norm 1-3s, spike, и затем Anthropic congestion
- Circuit breaker state per endpoint
- Per-user quota exhaustion (top-10 abusers)

Real incident: marketing campaign, затем 5× обычный трафик в час, token bucket throttles избыточный трафик, interactive юзеры стабильны, batch-jobs ждут, 0 ошибок на UI.

